* news_process v3.2.0 — Table 3: Mechanism (plan v14 §9.2)
*
* 机制变量: tone_gap_tech_app + tone_gap_sub_symb (双轨化对角线 + ctx 版本)
* 经济直觉:
*   tone_gap_tech_app 反映"技术层 vs 业务应用层"的舆论温差
*   tone_gap_sub_symb 反映"实质性 vs 象征性"信号差 (洗稿率 cheap-talk 通道, Bingler 2022 FRL)
*
* Main spec: locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}} sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

version 19

* fix(omni-g-templates-14, 2026-06-11): 隔离估计命名空间 — 主线模板链共享 session,
* 不 clear 时 Table 2 的陈旧 M1-M4 会在本表守卫跳过后被 esttab 静默复用
* (错误模型冒充机制回归列, 实证: esttab 对同名陈旧估计 rc=0 不告警)。
eststo clear

local DV     llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}

* Channel 1: tone_gap_tech_app (Adner & Kapoor 2010 SMJ + Gomber 2018 JMIS)
*  - 主 spec 用 _lc_ctx 版本 (entity-proximate); robustness 用 _lf 版本
local CH_TECH_APP   tone_gap_tech_app_lc_ctx
capture confirm variable tone_gap_tech_app
if !_rc {
    local CH_TECH_APP_ALT  tone_gap_tech_app
}

* Channel 2: tone_gap_sub_symb (W&Z 1998 ASQ + Bingler 2022 FRL cheap talk)
local CH_SUB_SYMB   tone_gap_sub_symb_sc_ctx
capture confirm variable tone_gap_sub_symb
if !_rc {
    local CH_SUB_SYMB_ALT  tone_gap_sub_symb
}

* M1: only Tech-App channel
capture confirm variable `CH_TECH_APP'
if !_rc {
    eststo M1: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `CH_TECH_APP', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* M2: only Sub-Symb channel
capture confirm variable `CH_SUB_SYMB'
if !_rc {
    eststo M2: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `CH_SUB_SYMB', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* M3: 双通道并列
capture confirm variable `CH_TECH_APP' `CH_SUB_SYMB'
if !_rc {
    eststo M3: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `CH_TECH_APP' `CH_SUB_SYMB', ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}

* M4: + bank 控制 (full mechanism spec)
* fix(omni-g-templates-14, 2026-06-11): bank_size/bank_age 缺失时加 else 降级分支
* (照 11_table2 M5 模式) — 旧版静默跳过 M4, 配合无 eststo clear 导致 Table 2 的
* 陈旧 M4 估计泄入本表第 4 列。降级分支退化为 M3 双通道规格, note 中如实披露。
capture confirm variable bank_size bank_age
if !_rc {
    eststo M4: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `CH_TECH_APP' `CH_SUB_SYMB' bank_size bank_age, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ bank_size/bank_age 不存在, M4 degrade 为双通道规格 (同 M3, 无 bank 控制)"
    capture confirm variable `CH_TECH_APP' `CH_SUB_SYMB'
    if !_rc {
        eststo M4: reghdfe `DV' digital_frontier `CH_TECH_APP' `CH_SUB_SYMB', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
    }
}

* 输出
* fix(omni-g-templates-14, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化。旧注释声称 "esttab 部分
* 缺失 spec 时仍输出可用列" 为假 — esttab 对缺名估计是 r(111) 硬崩, 对同名陈旧估计
* 是静默复用 (两种行为均经本机 StataNow 19.5 实证)。改为仅引用实际已存储的估计,
* mtitle 同步删列防错位。
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models M1 M2 M3 M4
local cand_titles `""Tech-App only" "Sub-Symb only" "Both" "+ Controls""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
if "`models'" == "" {
    display as error "  ⚠️ Table 3 无任何已存储估计 (机制通道列全缺), 表跳过"
}
else {
    esttab `models' using "output/tables/table3_mechanism.tex", ///
        se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) ///
        booktabs replace fragment ///
        title("Table 3: Mechanism — Tone Gap Channels (Tech-App + Sub-Symb)") ///
        mtitles(`mtitles') ///
        note("Channels: tone_gap_tech_app (Adner-Kapoor 2010 + Gomber 2018), tone_gap_sub_symb (W&Z 1998 + Bingler 2022). Robust SEs clustered at bank. M4 degrades to the two-channel spec when bank_size/bank_age are unavailable.")

    * fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel (parse_esttab_csv 消费;
    * estout+delimiter 防 esttab csv 的 ="..." 包裹破坏解析)
    estout `models' using "output/tables/table3_mechanism.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
        cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
        starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) mlabels(`mtitles')

    display "✅ Table 3 written to output/tables/table3_mechanism.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
}
